The QtJSBSim project is an adaptation of Marek Cel's QFlightInstruments
(http://sourceforge.net/projects/qfi/) example application to use the
JSBSim flight dynamics model (http://sourceforge.net/projects/jsbsim/) and
the PLIB libraries (http://plib.sourceforge.net) to create a flight
simulator.

The app is built with QtCreator, and requires the following dynamic libraries
be installed: PLIB (-lplib) and JSBSim (-lJSBSim).

