VERSION 2.0 NOTES ***********************************************************

1. You can now use the Start/Stop button to launch JSBSim
2. JSBSim console output (stdout) is written to a QPlainTextEdit widget
3. Increased the amount of data sent/received between QtJSBSim and JSBSim
4. The ini file is now in the source directory. This is to allow easy access
   to it for editing.  Please edit your installPath variable in mainwindow.cpp
   to match your system.